action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P55 on WSL GtkBackend: ported 2026-10-20 from actions/win/P55-press-the-styled-button.actions; the steps and pass condition are the Windows file's, quoted below. Positions from the AT-SPI dump under WSLg (x11), client coordinates, origin empty; a control named in a row's note was looked up by that name.
# P55(WSL):由 actions/win/P55-press-the-styled-button.actions 移植(2026-10-20),步驟與通過條件同下方 Windows 原文；座標取自 WSLg 下的 AT-SPI,為 client 座標。
# P55 on Windows: press the styled button twice with a real held press.
# Written 2026-10-08. mousedown / hold / mouseup rather than click, so the
# pressed state lasts long enough to be drawn; a zero-length click could pass
# clicks while drawing pressed zero times. (60,225) is the "Press me" centre
# from UIA minus the window origin, WinUIBackend, 100% scale, window 656x499.
# Pass: "clicks: 2" and "pressed draws: N" with N > 0.
# P55(Windows):以真正按住的方式按兩次自訂樣式按鈕。2026-10-08 撰寫。用 mousedown／停留／mouseup 而非 click,
# 讓按下狀態持續到足以被畫出來;零長度的點擊可能讓 clicks 增加、pressed 卻一次都沒畫。(60,225) 是 "Press me"
# 的 UIA 中心減去視窗原點,WinUIBackend,100% 縮放，視窗 656x499。通過:"clicks: 2" 且 "pressed draws: N" 的 N > 0。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P55 render,gtk
mousedown,56,180,,left,,,press and hold -- pressed draws must rise above 0,gtk
sleep,,,,,,400000,held,gtk
mouseup,56,180,,left,,,release -- clicks must become 1,gtk
sleep,,,,,,600000,let the counters redraw,gtk
mousedown,56,180,,left,,,press again,gtk
sleep,,,,,,400000,held,gtk
mouseup,56,180,,left,,,release -- clicks must become 2,gtk
sleep,,,,,,20000000,hold 20s so the final capture lands while the window is up,gtk
